      "content": "hey, im working on some long term risk projections for a new urban development fund. we're looking at a few specific zip codes that have been seeing a lot of demographic changes lately—mostly new immigrant communities moving in. from an actuarial standpoint, what kind of social volatility indicators should i be tracking to gauge if these shifts might impact property values or community stability over the next 10-15 years?",
